{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0d9700e6-65ef-8bb1-804c-9a8db0605c13",
  "created_at": "2026-02-11T16:15:03-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sarah Abdi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T16:12:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T16:12:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, it's about the certificate, the one for my brother-in-law. I need a copy of it to settle the estate. The bank wants the actual certified one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T16:12:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. A death certificate copy. Did he pass here in Newport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T16:13:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, at the hospital there, last month. January. The twelfth, I believe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T16:13:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, we can help with that. Can I get your name first?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T16:13:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sarah Abdi. A-B-D-I."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T16:13:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Sarah. And his name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T16:13:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I was going to come in person. I just need to know what ID to bring. Is a driver's license enough?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T16:13:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A valid photo ID like a driver's license is the usual thing, yes. Are you the executor, or are you listed on the estate paperwork?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T16:13:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm the one named in the will. The executor, yes. I have the court papers for that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T16:13:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, bring those along with your license. That shows your connection, so there's no back and forth at the counter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T16:13:48-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the death certificate, do I need more than one? The bank said one, but the others might want theirs too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T16:13:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A lot of people get a few copies, because each place usually keeps the one you hand them. It's easier to get them all at once than to come back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T16:14:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll ask for several then. Sorry, I'm in the car, my reception isn't great. [line breaks up] Can you hear me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T16:14:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can, you cut out for a second. You're fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T16:14:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I've been sitting in waiting rooms all week, so at least I have my book. I'm halfway through this long novel about a lighthouse keeper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T16:14:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that sounds lovely. Is it good?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T16:14:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's long, but yes. Anyway, what hours are you open? I'd like to come tomorrow if I can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T16:14:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We're open weekdays during regular business hours, so tomorrow morning is fine. Just come to the clerk's counter at City Hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T16:14:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. License, court papers, and the date and place. That's all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T16:14:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Bring his full name as well, and we'll take care of you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T16:14:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T16:14:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Sarah. I'm sorry for your loss. Take care."
    }
  ],
